# RC validation

- Campaign is **resume/merge**, never wipe history. Use merge/backfill helpers; preserve stamped `rc_validation_<timestamp>.json`.
- Artifacts live under `Data/diagnostics/`. Update `RC_REGRESSION_RETEST.md` when fixing campaign FAILs.
- Hardware mic RC only after `python main.py --agent-smoke` PASSes (and full unittest when Agent/Planner changed).
- Prefer root-cause fixes that clear many FAILs; avoid one-off integration bandaids unless the phase says so.
- CLI: `python main.py --rc-validation`, `--rc-merge-campaign`, `--debug-transcripts` only when privacy allows.
